{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876280/extras/2f656bfc3010806ea3181251690c504d.avif?t=1757013737\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>A person treks across a vast world of mystery and nightmares. They've armed themselves only with what they could find in their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person shooter full of strange horrors and uncomfortable sights, this game offers an experience of fast action and killing of various monsters that want to kill you. It features dark, atmospheric architecture, including that of castles, gothic structures, caves, tunnels, and more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has low-poly, pixelated visuals accompanying atmospheric ambient sound design and a work-in-progress soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay mechanics include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast-paced FPS action<br>- Short and simple puzzle-solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Secrets and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different weapon types and ammunition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemy types of varying degrees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- And more to come soon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for checking it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may email me with any questions or inquiries.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876280?t=1757013737","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876280/3370bdf49ecfa3e0a49abce7f1780e57b16db38e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757013737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876280/6996f45de370da56f7da68d8875dcd70aa9c38d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757013737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876280/6996f45de370da56f7da68d8875dcd70aa9c38d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757013737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains pixelated low-resolution depictions of blood and gore as well as psychologically horrific imagery and sound effects."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876280/extras/2f656bfc3010806ea3181251690c504d.avif?t=1757013737\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>A person treks across a vast world of mystery and nightmares. They've armed themselves only with what they could find in their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person shooter full of strange horrors and uncomfortable sights, this game offers an experience of fast action and killing of various monsters that want to kill you. It features dark, atmospheric architecture, including that of castles, gothic structures, caves, tunnels, and more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has low-poly, pixelated visuals accompanying atmospheric ambient sound design and a work-in-progress soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay mechanics include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast-paced FPS action<br>- Short and simple puzzle-solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Secrets and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different weapon types and ammunition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemy types of varying degrees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- And more to come soon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for checking it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may email me with any questions or inquiries.</p>","developers":["Archiducks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876280/6c4875977622f4544f7d9984e774fdd38675244c/header.jpg?t=1757013737","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184518,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184518/movie480.mp4?t=1757004669","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184518/movie_max.mp4?t=1757004669"},"name":"Echo of Lostness: DarkZone","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184518/40dd86ef44b1cd7b4603c7b18862ef7dfa91c4f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757004669","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184518/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757004669","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184518/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757004669"}}],"name":"Echo of Lostness: DarkZone","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel/AMD CPU (i5-6600, Ryzen 3 1200)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 1050<br></li><l